    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CF-02 · Knowledge Base Ingestion\nThree **separate** vector tables = three retrieval scopes (that is how role-based RAG is enforced):\n• `kb_hr_policy` ← handbook uploaded through the HR form (employees + HR)\n• `kb_job_descriptions` ← synced from the `jobs` table (everyone)\n• `kb_hire_patterns` ← synced from `hire_patterns` (HR + screening engine only)\n\n**Retrieval tuning for look-alike roles:** every chunk starts with a header `[Role | Job ID | Family | Seniority]`, carries `job_id/role_family/seniority` metadata, and each job gets a dedicated *\"how this role differs\"* chunk.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
